        <p>Warrington: 13111 Dec., 1915. • THE RICHMOND GAS STOVE &amp; METER ' COMPANY, LIMITED. NOTICE IS HERBY GIVEN that the Transfer Books of the Debenture Stock and Preference Shares of the Company will be CLOSED from December 22nd to December 31st, 1915, inclusive, for the purpose of preparing Warrants or Interest and Dividend. By Order of the Board. JAS. W. SLACK, Secretary. Academy-street, Warrington, Deeembet 18th, 1915. WARRINGTON MUSICAL SOCIETY IN AID OF WAR FUNDS: "THE MESSIAH"</p>
