      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1915-12-18_WidnesExaminer_art0030" n="art0030">
        <head>NO ONE FORGOTTEN ON CHRISTMAS DAY.</head>
        <p>NO ONE FORGOTTEN ON CHRISTMAS DAY.</p>
        <p>Of course not. All the same, it taxes one's ingenuity to choose something really novel for every member of the family, to say nothing of members of other families in whom one is inter- ested. Difficulties like these</p>
        <p>vanish directly you enter our Establishment. Our stock is so varied, and the class of articles so superior, that every taste can be gratified. If you want a Christmas - giving inspiration, just take a look at our stock.</p>
