      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1915-12-18_WidnesExaminer_art0136" n="art0136">
        <p>OVERWORK and worry don't pay. Nobody can defy Nature's laws. We all need peace of mind, rest, outdoor exercise and eight hours' sleep to keep well. We must not overeat, nor drink much, un- less it be milk or water.</p>
        <p>Unwise habits load the blood with uric poisons. The kidneys act as safety-valves, filtering the blood and passing off the poisons, but are bound to weaken under any long continued strain, and, once they falter, you feel dull, tired and nervous. Your back aches, you lose weight, you have headaches, dizzy spells and urinary disorders. The first thing to do is to get back to simple, sensible habits. You must also help the weakened kidneys. You can depend for this on Doan's Backache Kidney Pills.</p>
        <p>Many in Warrington have learned their worth and willingly tell about it.</p>
        <p>Send for Free Book on " Moderation, Cheer- fulness, and Other Long Life Laws."</p>
